  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Additional support FAM - FAM Basket fund</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Additional support FAM</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Detta projekt utg&#xf6;r ett brost&#xf6;d till FAM (det bolivianska kommunf&#xf6;rbundet) under utarbetandet av den nya tre&#xe5;rsplanen. Under sex m&#xe5;nader kommer organisationens samtliga aktiviteter, samt utvecklingen av den nya planen att finansieras tillsammans med Danmark och Holland.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project consists in a &quot;bridging support&quot; to the municipal association FAM during its development of its new plan for the coming three years. During six months the daily work of the organisation and activities related to the development of the plan will be financed together with Denmark and Holland.</narrative>
  </description>
